# The Cursor side is a projection of .claude/, written by scripts/cursor.mjs on every install
# and update. Keeping a copy of it in the kit is how it goes stale: a rule changes here, the
# copy does not, and half the team reads last week's rules. Generate it when you need it:
# node scripts/cursor.mjs
.cursor/

node_modules/

# Notes on building the kit, and the scratch a session leaves behind. Personal to the machine
# they were written on, and a distraction in a repository people clone to get the kit itself.
_dev/
_fix/
